 to caregivers to help him transfer and that he is completely blind from his stroke . I still adore him and miss him at the same time. I still see his beauty and strength of character.", "beautifully said. gratitude is everything.", "💛✨", "Pride is nasty", "Such a beautiful reminder—so touching and hopeful."], "mechanic_tags": ["carousel", "explicit_prompt", "direct_you", "heartbreak"]}, "evidence_paths": {"folder": "references/text-style/content-dump/live-smoke-2026-06-16/posts/ig_DUtQzmaj9Rw", "public_html": "references/text-style/content-dump/live-smoke-2026-06-16/posts/ig_DUtQzmaj9Rw/public_page.html", "record_json": "references/text-style/content-dump/live-smoke-2026-06-16/posts/ig_DUtQzmaj9Rw/record.json"}, "gaps": [{"field": "assets[].ocr_text", "reason": "OCR is a separate pass over downloaded images/screenshots.", "status": "not_attempted"}, {"field": "assets[].visual_notes", "reason": "Visual/style analysis should run after assets are downloaded.", "status": "not_attempted"}, {"field": "assets[].remote_url", "reason": "Public unauthenticated Instagram HTML did not expose every carousel child URL.", "status": "not_scraped"}, {"field": "public_html", "reason": "Public page fetch did not return parseable Instagram meta tags.", "status": "not_scraped"}, {"field": "metrics.saves", "reason": "Third-party saves are not public Instagram metrics.", "status": "not_scraped"}, {"field": "metrics.shares", "reason": "Third-party shares are not public Instagram metrics.", "status": "not_scraped"}], "id": "ig:DUtQzmaj9Rw", "metrics": {"comments": 1417, "likes": 615337, "plays": 0, "public_html_comments": null, "public_html_likes": null, "views": 0, "winner_score": 679102.0}, "post_type": "carousel", "public_html": {"account_username": null, "canonical_url": null, "caption_preview": null, "comments": null, "instagram_media_id": null, "likes": null, "owner_user_id": null, "primary_image_url": null, "published_label": null, "raw_description": "", "status": "public_meta_missi