omen choosing lives that feel true to them.\n\nHowever this day finds you, I hope you move through it gently. \n\nWritten by @williegreene_", "word_count": 86}, "communication_seed": {"first_comment": "This post and these words are everything mothers and woman need to hear ❤️🔥❤️", "latest_comments": ["This post and these words are everything mothers and woman need to hear ❤️🔥❤️", "My brother said I’m his second mama 🤍", "Wow this one was deep", "@_frederique1981_", "@muvamarie94 🌸", "Beautiful", "@margalepiten sorry naman po. karun lang naka IG 😢\nI love you sizzy❤"], "mechanic_tags": ["carousel", "explicit_prompt", "direct_you", "first_person", "domestic"]}, "evidence_paths": {"folder": "references/text-style/content-dump/live-smoke-2026-06-16/posts/ig_DYJczlHlQmM", "public_html": "references/text-style/content-dump/live-smoke-2026-06-16/posts/ig_DYJczlHlQmM/public_page.html", "record_json": "references/text-style/content-dump/live-smoke-2026-06-16/posts/ig_DYJczlHlQmM/record.json"}, "gaps": [{"field": "assets[].ocr_text", "reason": "OCR is a separate pass over downloaded images/screenshots.", "status": "not_attempted"}, {"field": "assets[].visual_notes", "reason": "Visual/style analysis should run after assets are downloaded.", "status": "not_attempted"}, {"field": "assets[].remote_url", "reason": "Public unauthenticated Instagram HTML did not expose every carousel child URL.", "status": "not_scraped"}, {"field": "public_html", "reason": "Public page fetch did not return parseable Instagram meta tags.", "status": "not_scraped"}, {"field": "metrics.saves", "reason": "Third-party saves are not public Instagram metrics.", "status": "not_scraped"}, {"field": "metrics.shares", "reason": "Third-party shares are not public Instagram metrics.", "status": "not_scraped"}], "id": "ig:DYJczlHlQmM", "metrics": {"comments": 1065, "likes": 473527, "plays": 0, "public_html_comments": null, "public_html_likes": null, "views": 0, "winner_score": 521452.0}, "post_type": "carousel", 